---
description: >-
  The same three-step linear flow as 17-direction-bottom-up.mmd
  (Browse -> Checkout -> Download receipt), rendered with `direction RL`
  (right to left) instead.
---
usecase-beta
    direction RL
    %% Actors
    actor Customer
    Browse("Browse catalog")
    Checkout("Checkout")
    Receipt[Download receipt]

    %% Relationships
    Customer --> Browse
    Browse --> Checkout
    Checkout --> Receipt
